<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>CityPulse Daily Briefing - Mumbai Air Quality Decision Support</title>
  <style>
    @page {
      size: A4 portrait;
      margin: 10mm 12mm 10mm 12mm;
    }
    *, *::before, *::after {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "SF Pro Text", Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;
      color: #1D1D1F;
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      font-size: 9.5pt;
      line-height: 1.35;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    .header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      border-bottom: 2px solid #1D1D1F;
      padding-bottom: 6px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .brand h1 {
      font-size: 18pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      color: #1D1D1F;
    }
    .brand p {
      font-size: 9pt;
      color: #6E6E73;
    }
    .meta-box {
      text-align: right;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      color: #6E6E73;
    }
    .meta-box strong {
      color: #1D1D1F;
    }
    .summary-strip {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .stat-card {
      background-color: #F5F5F7;
      border: 1px solid #D2D2D7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
    }
    .stat-card .val {
      font-size: 14pt;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #1D1D1F;
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .stat-card .lbl {
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      color: #6E6E73;
    }
    h2 {
      font-size: 11pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #1D1D1F;
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E5EA;
      padding-bottom: 3px;
    }
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 11px;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    th {
      background-color: #F5F5F7;
      color: #1D1D1F;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 5px 6px;
      border-top: 1px solid #D2D2D7;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #D2D2D7;
      font-size: 8pt;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.4px;
    }
    td {
      padding: 4.5px 6px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E5E5EA;
      vertical-align: top;
    }
    tr:nth-child(even) td {
      background-color: #FAFAFC;
    }
    .pill {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 1px 7px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .pill-good {
      background-color: #E8F8ED;
      color: #135E26;
      border: 1px solid #A3E5B5;
    }
    .pill-unhealthy {
      background-color: #FFF4E5;
      color: #8A4B00;
      border: 1px solid #FCD399;
    }
    .pill-severe {
      background-color: #FFEBEA;
      color: #9C1C14;
      border: 1px solid #FCA5A0;
    }
    .alert-tag {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: #D70015;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin-top: 2px;
    }
    .patterns-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .pattern-card {
      background-color: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1px solid #D2D2D7;
      border-radius: 6px;
      padding: 6px 8px;
    }
    .pattern-card h3 {
      font-size: 8.5pt;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #0071E3;
      margin-bottom: 3px;
    }
    .pattern-card p {
      font-size: 7.8pt;
      color: #1D1D1F;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }
    .pattern-card .stat {
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: #6E6E73;
      margin-top: 3px;
    }
    .model-table th, .model-table td {
      padding: 4px 6px;
    }
    .limitations-box {
      background-color: #F5F5F7;
      border-left: 3px solid #0071E3;
      padding: 5px 8px;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: #3A3A3C;
      line-height: 1.35;
      border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0;
    }
    .footer {
      border-top: 1px solid #D2D2D7;
      padding-top: 4px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: #86868B;
    }
    @media print {
      body {
        background-color: #FFFFFF !important;
        -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact;
        print-color-adjust: exact;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="header">
    <div class="brand">
      <h1>CityPulse Briefing</h1>
      <p>Municipal Air Quality & Intervention Prioritization • Mumbai Metropolitan Region</p>
    </div>
    <div class="meta-box">
      <div><strong>Forecast Horizon:</strong> Next 24 Hours (t+24h)</div>
      <div><strong>Issue Date:</strong> {{ as_of_date }}</div>
      <div><strong>Decision Cycle:</strong> Daily Operations Briefing</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Summary Statistics Strip -->
  <div class="summary-strip">
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="val">{{ total_stations }}</div>
      <div class="lbl">Monitoring Stations</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="val" style="color: {{ '#D70015' if at_risk_count > 0 else '#34C759' }};">{{ at_risk_count }}</div>
      <div class="lbl">At-Risk Stations (>60 µg/m³)</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="val">{{ median_forecast }} µg/m³</div>
      <div class="lbl">Citywide Median Forecast</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-card">
      <div class="val">{{ conformal_coverage }}%</div>
      <div class="lbl">Calibrated 80% Coverage</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 1: Prioritized Action Plan -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>1. Top-5 Prioritized Station Interventions</h2>
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th style="width: 5%;">#</th>
          <th style="width: 26%;">Monitoring Station</th>
          <th style="width: 14%;">Forecast & 80% Band</th>
          <th style="width: 11%;">Risk Tier</th>
          <th style="width: 8%;">Score</th>
          <th style="width: 36%;">Recommended Action & Operational Alert</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {% for st in ranked_stations %}
        <tr>
          <td><strong>{{ st.rank }}</strong></td>
          <td>
            <strong>{{ st.station_name.split(',')[0] }}</strong><br>
            <span style="font-size: 7pt; color: #6E6E73;">ID: {{ st.station_id }} • {{ st.quality_label }} Quality</span>
          </td>
          <td>
            <strong>{{ st.predicted_pm25 }} µg/m³</strong><br>
            <span style="font-size: 7.2pt; color: #6E6E73;">[{{ st.lower }} – {{ st.upper }}]</span>
          </td>
          <td>
            <span class="pill pill-{{ st.predicted_class.lower() }}">{{ st.predicted_class }}</span>
          </td>
          <td><strong>{{ "%.2f"|format(st.risk_score) }}</strong></td>
          <td>
            <div>{{ st.action }}</div>
            {% if st.warning %}
            <div class="alert-tag">{{ st.warning }}</div>
            {% endif %}
            <div style="font-size: 7pt; color: #6E6E73; margin-top: 1px;">Key Driver: {{ st.primary_driver }}</div>
          </td>
        </tr>
        {% endfor %}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 2: Observed Environmental Patterns -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>2. Recurring Operational Pollution Patterns (Historical Ground Truth)</h2>
    <div class="patterns-grid">
      <div class="pattern-card">
        <h3>Diurnal Morning Peak</h3>
        <p>{{ patterns.evening_peak.sentence }}</p>
        <div class="stat">Peak Hour: {{ "%02d:00"|format(patterns.evening_peak.peak_hour) }} IST | Uplift: +{{ patterns.evening_peak.percentage_difference }}%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pattern-card">
        <h3>Calm-Wind Stagnation</h3>
        <p>{{ patterns.calm_wind_episodes.sentence }}</p>
        <div class="stat">Calm Threshold: &le;{{ patterns.calm_wind_episodes.q1_wind_speed }} km/h | Uplift: +{{ patterns.calm_wind_episodes.percentage_difference }}%</div>
      </div>
      <div class="pattern-card">
        <h3>Persistent Worst Corridors</h3>
        <p>{{ patterns.persistent_worst_stations.sentence }}</p>
        <div class="stat">Top Corridors: Kherwadi, Byculla, BKC</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 3: Model vs Baseline Performance -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>3. Predictive Model vs. Baseline Evaluation (Out-of-Time Test Block: Feb 2026)</h2>
    <table class="model-table">
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th>Methodology</th>
          <th>Test Block MAE (µg/m³)</th>
          <th>Test Block F1 (Unhealthy+)</th>
          <th>Sample Size</th>
          <th>Operational Production Status</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>Persistence Benchmark</strong> (Carry forward t to t+24h)</td>
          <td><strong>{{ metrics.baselines.persistence.mae }}</strong></td>
          <td><strong>{{ metrics.baselines.persistence.f1_unhealthy_or_worse }}</strong></td>
          <td>{{ metrics.test_period.total_samples }} obs</td>
          <td>Benchmark (captures strong diurnal autocorrelation)</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>24-Hour Moving Average Baseline</strong></td>
          <td>{{ metrics.baselines.moving_average_24h.mae }}</td>
          <td>{{ metrics.baselines.moving_average_24h.f1_unhealthy_or_worse }}</td>
          <td>{{ metrics.test_period.total_samples }} obs</td>
          <td>Secondary baseline</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td><strong>LightGBM Classifier & Regressor (CityPulse ML)</strong></td>
          <td>{{ metrics.lightgbm_regressor.mae }}</td>
          <td>{{ metrics.lightgbm_classifier.f1_unhealthy_or_worse }}</td>
          <td>{{ metrics.test_period.total_samples }} obs</td>
          <td><strong>Deployed</strong> (Beats moving average; yields calibrated risk probabilities & SHAP)</td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <!-- Section 4: Operational Limitations & Provenance -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>4. Governance, Provenance & Known Limitations</h2>
    <div class="limitations-box">
      <strong>Data Provenance:</strong> Ground-level PM2.5 monitored by CPCB / MPCB stations (aggregated by OpenAQ). Meteorological features from Open-Meteo Historical Archive.<br>
      <strong>Governing Limitations:</strong> Next-24-hour wind speed and rainfall features use historical observations as numerical weather prediction (NWP) stand-ins. 80% prediction intervals are conformal-calibrated to achieve {{ conformal_coverage }}% empirical coverage on out-of-time tests. Risk scores reflect pure model risk and are never silently altered by data quality flags.
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    <div>CityPulse Decision Support • Open-source municipal planning • Built for Mumbai Municipal Corporation</div>
    <div>Page 1 of 1 (A4 Printable Document)</div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
